sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SRC as AXI Source
  participant DUT as AXI_RgbToGrayscale
  participant RGB as RGB Output Branch
  participant GRAY as Gray8 Output Branch
  participant SNK as AXI Sink

  SRC->>DUT: TVALID=1, TDATA(R|B|G), TUSER/TLAST
  DUT-->>SRC: TREADY=1 when pending slot free
  DUT->>RGB: m_axis_rbg888_tvalid + data
  DUT->>GRAY: m_axis_gray8_tvalid + data

  alt downstream backpressure on RGB
    SNK-->>RGB: m_axis_rbg888_tready=0
    DUT->>GRAY: gray branch may still fire
    DUT-->>SRC: s_axis_video_tready=0 until both branches ack
  else no backpressure
    SNK-->>RGB: m_axis_rbg888_tready=1
    DUT-->>SRC: accept next beat
  end

  Note over DUT: SOF/EOL sidebands are kept beat-aligned on both branches.
